<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firm buys 23,000 T wheat, 7,000 T soybean.</title>
<headline>Manila firm buys 23,000 T wheat, 7,000 T soybean.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Philippine firm bought 23,000 tonnes of wheat and 7,000 tonnes of U.S. soybean, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Traders said of the 23,000 tonnes of wheat bought late on Thursday, 16,000 was Canadian dark northern spring wheat and 7,000 was U.S. western white wheat.</p>
<p>The traders said the delivery date was set for August.</p>
<p>The purchase price could not be immediately determined.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
